      "title": "识别整体导数计算指数三角积分",
      "stem": "求不定积分\n$$\\int \\frac{1+\\sin x}{1+\\cos x}e^x\\,dx.$$",
      "question_type": "calculation",
      "difficulty_level": 2,
      "answers": [
        {
          "answer_type": "symbolic",
          "answer_text": "$\\displaystyle e^x\\frac{\\sin x}{1+\\cos x}+C$",
          "is_primary": true
        }
      ],
      "solutions": [
        {
          "title": "构造乘积的导数",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "计算得 $(\\sin x/(1+\\cos x))'=1/(1+\\cos x)$。因此\n$$\\frac d{dx}\\left(e^x\\frac{\\sin x}{1+\\cos x}\\right)=e^x\\frac{\\sin x+1}{1+\\cos x},$$\n所以积分即为该表达式加常数。",
          "main_method_code": "recognize_exact_derivative",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "role": "compute",
              "text": "求 $\\sin x/(1+\\cos x)$ 的导数。"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "与 $e^x$ 使用乘积求导，识别出原被积函数。",
              "method_code": "recognize_exact_derivative"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "conclude",
              "text": "写出原函数并加积分常数。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
