      },
      "title": "由二分增量条件推出一阶小量",
      "stem": "设 $f:(0,1)\\to\\mathbb R$，满足\n$$\\lim_{x\\to0^+}f(x)=0,\\qquad \\lim_{x\\to0^+}\\frac{f(x)-f(x/2)}x=0.$$\n求\n$$\\lim_{x\\to0^+}\\frac{f(x)}x.$$",
      "question_type": "proof",
      "difficulty_level": 3,
      "answers": [
        {
          "answer_type": "numeric",
          "answer_text": "$0$",
          "is_primary": true
        }
      ],
      "solutions": [
        {
          "title": "二分望远镜展开",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "令 $h(x)=[f(x)-f(x/2)]/x$，则 $h(x)\\to0$。对固定 $x$ 作望远镜展开并令项数趋于无穷，利用 $f(x/2^m)\\to0$ 得\n$$\\frac{f(x)}x=\\sum_{k=0}^\\infty 2^{-k}h(x/2^k).$$\n于是\n$$\\left|\\frac{f(x)}x\\right|\\le2\\sup_{0<t\\le x}|h(t)|\\to0.$$",
          "main_method_code": "dyadic_telescoping",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "role": "transform",
              "text": "定义归一化二分增量 $h(x)$。"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "把 $f(x)$ 写成沿 $x,x/2,x/4,\\ldots$ 的无穷望远镜和。",
              "method_code": "dyadic_telescoping"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "compute",
              "text": "用几何级数权重估计为 $2\\sup_{0<t\\le x}|h(t)|$。"
            },
            {
              "order": 4,
              "role": "conclude",
              "text": "由 $h(t)\\to0$ 得所求极限为 $0$。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
