      "title": "平面截椭球所得椭圆的面积",
      "stem": "平面 $x+y+z=0$ 与椭球面 $x^2+y^2+4z^2=1$ 相交得到椭圆，求该椭圆面积 $S$。",
      "question_type": "calculation",
      "difficulty_level": 3,
      "answers": [
        {
          "answer_type": "symbolic",
          "answer_text": "$\\displaystyle S=\\frac{\\pi}{\\sqrt3}$",
          "is_primary": true
        }
      ],
      "solutions": [
        {
          "title": "先求投影椭圆再换算实际面积",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "由 $z=-x-y$，投影区域满足 $5x^2+8xy+5y^2\\le1$。其二次型矩阵行列式为 $9$，故在 $xy$ 平面的面积为 $\\pi/3$。平面图形面积元满足 $dS=\\sqrt{1+z_x^2+z_y^2}\\,dxdy=\\sqrt3\\,dxdy$，因此实际面积为 $\\sqrt3\\cdot\\pi/3=\\pi/\\sqrt3$。",
          "main_method_code": "projection_area_scaling",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "role": "transform",
              "text": "消去 $z$，得到截线在 $xy$ 平面上的投影椭圆。"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "role": "compute",
              "text": "由二次型行列式计算投影面积为 $\\pi/3$。"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "乘以平面面积元伸缩因子 $\\sqrt3$。",
              "method_code": "projection_area_scaling"
            },
            {
              "order": 4,
              "role": "conclude",
              "text": "得到 $S=\\pi/\\sqrt3$。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
