      "title": "Taylor 等价量判定参数级数收敛",
      "stem": "求使级数\n$$\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\left(\\frac1n\\csc\\frac1n-1\\right)^{2025p}$$\n收敛的实数 $p$ 的取值范围。",
      "question_type": "calculation",
      "difficulty_level": 2,
      "answers": [
        {
          "answer_type": "symbolic",
          "answer_text": "$\\displaystyle p>\\frac1{4050}$",
          "is_primary": true
        }
      ],
      "solutions": [
        {
          "title": "Taylor 展开后与 p 级数比较",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "令 $t=1/n$。由 $t/\\sin t=1+t^2/6+O(t^4)$，得 $n^{-1}\\csc(n^{-1})-1\\sim1/(6n^2)$。所以通项渐近等价于 $6^{-2025p}n^{-4050p}$。底数为正，原级数收敛当且仅当 $4050p>1$。",
          "main_method_code": "asymptotic_equivalence_comparison",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "role": "compute",
              "text": "展开 $t/\\sin t-1\\sim t^2/6$。",
              "method_code": "taylor_expansion_method"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "role": "transform",
              "text": "得到级数通项与常数乘 $n^{-4050p}$ 渐近等价。",
              "method_code": "asymptotic_equivalence_comparison"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "conclude",
              "text": "由 p 级数判别得到 $p>1/4050$。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
